          "command": "tensward analyse --project /p/lf --engine-arg max-num-seqs=34 --engine-arg gpu-memory-utilization=0.95 --goal ttft",
          "costs": "less memory headroom: the engine may fail to start",
          "evidence": "strong",
          "key": "more-kv-memory",
          "kind": "suggestion",
          "name": "more-kv-memory",
          "near": false,
          "quality_risk": false,
          "reason": "raising max_concurrent_requests above 32 is blocked: requests queue at the cap and the highest sampled KV-cache usage is 72%, too high for a larger cap to fit; kv_memory_fraction is the engine default. Raising it to 0.95 gives the engine more of the GPU's memory for the KV cache, which may not be enough to raise the cap, and leaves the GPU less memory headroom, so the engine may fail to start or run out of memory; sized in KV tokens, the larger pool holds 34 requests, so the command also sets max_concurrent_requests 34",
          "test": "about 5 min on this setup (this run: 51 s to load, 4.6 min to warm up and measure)",
          "tier": "could_help"
        },
