          "basis": "your prompts",
          "command": "tensward analyse --project /p/lf --engine-arg max-num-seqs=32 --engine-arg 'speculative-config={\"method\": \"ngram\", \"num_speculative_tokens\": 4, \"prompt_lookup_max\": 4}' --goal ttft",
          "costs": "does not change TTFT (prefill is unchanged); helps throughput and TPOT; TPOT rises when answers do not copy the prompt, and at high concurrency; a slower start",
          "evidence": "moderate",
          "key": "ngram-speculation",
          "kind": "suggestion",
          "name": "ngram-speculation",
          "near": false,
          "quality_risk": false,
          "reason": "prompts are long (median 1523 words beyond what they share). N-gram speculation drafts tokens by copying spans of the prompt, so it only helps when answers quote or repeat their input; otherwise it costs a little - compare TPOT with and without it",
